  "description": "This is structured as a standard opening, adaptable to fast castle, early aggression, or economic play.\n\nKey Byzantine Tips\n\n    Mining Camps & Houses = Bonus Stone → Always build near resources.\n\n    Cisterns cost 125 Stone, and give eco value – prioritize building them early.\n\n    Grand Winery landmark is essential for midgame food and gold trickle.\n\n    Vulnerability: Stone and early systems can be harassed → scout and defend.",
